    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "been thinking a lot lately. you know how sometimes the sea comes in and goes out? i feel like i've been watching the tide go out on my life for the past few years. wife gone, best friend died, my back's wrecked so i can't do half the things i used to, work's basically dead-ended. my son moved to australia three years ago. we talk maybe once a month if i'm lucky.\n\nit's not like any one thing destroyed it. it's just... quieter every year. smaller. i look around and there's not much left.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
